  },
  "data_semantics": {
    "intervals": "half-open [start, end), timezone-aware",
    "amber": "start_time is one second past the boundary; the interval is [end_time - duration, end_time); per_kwh is the price, $/kWh",
    "openadr": "each row is [datetime, datetime + interval_minutes); the block's unit is the price unit; a row with no value is dropped",
    "localvolts_v2": "one row per direction (Buy, Sell) paired on intervalEnd (UTC); [intervalEnd - intervalDuration, intervalEnd), 5 minutes when undeclared; rates (flexUp) in c/kWh; the matched rate is matchedCost ($) / (volume x proportionP2P), $/kWh, and 0.01 kWh or less matched is an explicit no-match; quality Fcst is a forecast, Exp/Act/Sub/FSub an elapsed interval"
  },
